      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CELESTIAL NEBULAE (8) added to his recent string of strong performances last start when runner-up over 1790m at this track, beaten 11 metres. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Won't find this any harder and he can go one better without surprising. PRIDDY CARSON (7) went back last start then worked home in good style to finish just 1.2 metres from the winner in second at this venue over 2190m, that run following his sixth at the same circuit two runs back. Primary contender based on that recent effort. BERSAGLIERE (5) is a great chance after a string of sound recent performances, the latest a solid fourth here over 1790m. Hard to find fault. BAZZAS LEGACY (3) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 2190m at this course last time out.",
